# Python Customer Behavior EDA

## Business Problem

The goal of this project is to analyze online retail customer behavior to identify high-value customers, purchase patterns, revenue trends, and customer segments.

## Dataset

UCI Online Retail Dataset  
Source: https://archive.ics.uci.edu/ml/datasets/Online+Retail

## Tools Used

- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Jupyter Notebook

## Key Analysis Areas

- Data cleaning
- Missing values
- Duplicate records
- Revenue calculation
- Monthly revenue trend
- Customer purchase frequency
- Top products
- Customer segmentation

